<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="#Sec_3_s08__Rewards_and_Incentives">
  <rdf:type rdf:resource="#SpecSection"/>
  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">s08::Rewards and Incentives</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">[Academic and explanatory] Draft suggestion for section: Rewards and Incentives
Context: Cybersecurity training, weekly tasks, points and levels
- Reward types: points, badges, level progression
- Reward triggers: task completion, weekly streak bonuses
- Anti-cheat: daily limits and duplicate task prevention
- Feedback: instant notification and weekly summary

Acceptance Criteria:
1. Section contains explanatory text.
2. At least three actionable requirements exist.
3. Output format or evaluation metric is defined.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

